					"content": "That guy? I remember him saying it was time for him to move on.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111131203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mo"
				},
				{
					"id": 111131203,
					"content": "Ah, good for him. I wonder where he's off to next?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111131204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shu'yang"
				},
				{
